<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="69bd4176">&lt;p&gt;
    The structure, contents and detail of the document will vary depending on project scope and client requirements;
    however, it should clearly state the organization’s mission, vision, values, strategies, and tactics. Critical
    assumptions (&lt;a class=&quot;elementLink&quot;
    href=&quot;./../../core.bus.concepts.base/guidances/termdefinitions/critical_assumption_E51E0AA9.html&quot;
    guid=&quot;_UAEt4KJ3EeS2LtdMC9QHew&quot;&gt;critical assumption&lt;/a&gt;) and critical success factors (&lt;a class=&quot;elementLink&quot;
    href=&quot;./../../core.bus.concepts.base/guidances/termdefinitions/critical_success_factor_1E15573A.html&quot;
    guid=&quot;_YNnFUKJ3EeS2LtdMC9QHew&quot;&gt;critical success factor (CSF)&lt;/a&gt;) should also be included within the document.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="b3cf6f24"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="b8fb207a">&lt;p&gt;
    Be sure to validate, preferably through in-person workshops, in order to gain consensus amongst all appropriate
    stakeholders before finalizing. The resulting documentation should be created with the larger target audience in
    mind.  Roles and responsibilities to maintain the document should also be determined.   
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="ca0e241c"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="b0d0c58a">&lt;p&gt;
    The purpose of this artifact is to:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Help make the organization fully aware of their strategies, goals, objectives, tactics, and initiatives.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Help organizations track activities and assess their appropriateness.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Serve as a source of reference to project teams by clearly communicating the overall vision.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Provide better alignment of behaviors with the business direction.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="impactOfNotHaving" nodeId="9902551d">If the business strategy is not documented, it can easily become misaligned.</attribute>
<attribute name="reasonsForNotNeeding" nodeId="d5bb66e3"></attribute>
<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="6b49084b"></attribute>
<attribute name="representationOptions" nodeId="2ad11a07">The business strategy should be documented in a format which is easy to visualize and review. Microsoft Word, modeling
tools (such as Aris) or a combination of tools can be used.</attribute>
<attribute name="representation" nodeId="c08bed2e"></attribute>
